{"n": 10, "kind": "paragraph", "text": "The electric field outside the shell is as though the total charge is concentrated at the centre. The same result is true for a solid sphere of uniform volume charge density. The field is zero at all points inside the shell.", "book_id": "PHY12O", "chapter_num": 1, "page": "044"}
